---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
import Button from "./Button.astro";
import { CONTACT_FORM_URL } from "../lib/constants";
---

<section class="section section--white">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <SectionHeading eyebrow="Get Involved" title="Parent Engagement & Volunteering" />

    <p>
      Trail Life runs on parent involvement &mdash; it&rsquo;s part of the design, not an ask on top of
      it. Troops led entirely by volunteer parents and church members give every boy consistent,
      trustworthy adult mentorship. Whether you can commit to a regular leadership role or just show
      up and help out at outings, there&rsquo;s a place for you.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Matthew Kennedy</strong> serves as our Membership Chair. Whether you&rsquo;re ready to join
      or just have questions about getting involved, please click the button below to send us a message
      directly.
    </p>

    <div class="engagement-cta-wrap">
      <Button href={CONTACT_FORM_URL} target="_blank" data-contact-trigger="true">Contact Us</Button>
    </div>

    <a class="resource-link" href="https://www.traillifeusa.com/raising-godly-boys/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Resources for parents: Raising Godly Boys &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .engagement-cta-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .resource-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
